title: "LaTeX source and verification code for the paper The Conjectures of Ashoke Sen"
abstract: "The complete LaTeX source of the paper of the same name, with its figures and the compiled PDF, the exact-arithmetic computation of the dyon indices that refute the positivity conjecture, and a kernel-checked Lean 4 certificate of the finite arithmetic."
